!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = ChIP DNA, input DNA or cDNA were subject to end repair, A-tailing, adaptor ligation and cleavage with USER enzyme, followed by size selection to 250-500 bp and amplification with NEBNext sequencing primers. Libraries were purified, quantified, multiplexed and sequenced with 1x75bp single-end reads on an Illumina NEXT-seq (Stanford Functional Genomics Facility).
!Sample_data_processing = The base calling was done using bcl2fastq v2.17.1.14 (Illumina).
!Sample_data_processing = CasTLE analysis for the CRISPR screen was performed as previously described (Morgens et al, 2016)
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: human (hg38)
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: txt files including the name, location and function of identified genes, as well as their effect size and CasTLE scores
